'''Magical Pokémon Journey: Raichu's Best Friend''' is the twenty-fourth monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Magical Pokémon Journey]] manga created by [[Yumi Tsukirino]]. It contains the 14th and 15th bouns chapters of the manga. The chapters originally released in this book were later re-released as part of {{Vol|Magical Pokémon Journey|6}}. As a bonus, it contained a fold-out color poster which was not part of the regular volume.
==Blurb==
'''''RAICHU'S BEST FRIEND'''''

''The Pokémon meet a Raichu trainer who actually lives in a Pokémon tower. Does that mean she's a ghost? And what else should they know about her? '' 

''Then, Machamp tries to woo a finicky Vaporeon, but will its attempts prove successful this time around?''

